<title>CHILE: Chilean inflation at 0.5 pct in Sept - sources.</title>
<headline>Chilean inflation at 0.5 pct in Sept - sources.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices rose 0.5 percent in Chile last month, down from 0.6 percent in the same month last year and 0.4 percent in August, market sources said.</p>
<p>The National Statistics Institute was due to report the official figure later Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>--Froilan Romero, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
</text>
